OL,3,GNEWSASupermodel's 'full circle moment'
OL,4,Aas Ireland Fashion Week impresses
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanadian supermodel Coco Rocha has
OL,7,Fdescribed Ireland's fashion scene as
OL,8,F"amazing" and said a national fashion
OL,9,Fweek "should have probably happened
OL,10,Fyears ago", after making her first
OL,11,Fvisit to the country.
OL,13,FLeading fashion industry figures,
OL,14,Fincluding activist and model Alana
OL,15,FHadid, descended on Slane Castle in
OL,16,FCounty Meath earlier this week as
OL,17,FIreland Fashion Week got under way.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
