OL,3,GNEWSASupermodel's 'full circle moment'
OL,4,Aas Ireland Fashion Week impresses
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow in its second year, more than 80
OL,7,Fdesigners are taking part in the
OL,8,Fsix-day event, which is billed as a
OL,9,Fshowcase for Irish fashion, culture and
OL,10,Fcreativity with shows, talks and
OL,11,Fexhibitions planned across the country.
OL,13,FRocha, whose career spans more than 20
OL,14,Fyears, said modelling at the event felt
OL,15,Flike a "full circle moment", as she was
OL,16,Ffirst discovered at an Irish dancing
OL,17,Fcompetition as a teenager.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
